.env
data/*
# seen_deals.json intentionally NOT tracked: it changes every run and
# conflicts with the 10-minute drain commits.  It lives in the private
# data repo (GH_REPO_DATA) with the other machine state.
!data/websearch_state.json
!data/eval_set.csv
!data/eval_baseline.json
# Both committed by the telegram_drain workflow: the read cursor prevents
# command replay, and run_quota makes /run rate limits survive the
# ephemeral CI runner (otherwise every 10-min run resets the cooldown).
!data/telegram_offset.json
!data/run_quota.json
logs/*
!logs/latest_deals.md
# internal review/working notes — not for the public repo
docs/archive/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
